@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K106
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;経験の変更は齟齬が出る場合がありますので、CSVを修正し同梱する事を推奨します

PRINTL
PRINTFORMW 「Eh? Hey, you...」
PRINTFORMDW --You're passing through the road when someone stops you in your tracks.
PRINTFORMDW Looking towards the direction of the voice, you spot a girl staring at you.
IF TALENT:MASTER:190 == 6
PRINTFORMDL [0] Wait, I know you!
ENDIF
PRINTFORMDL [1] I don't think we've met...
$LOOP
INPUT
IF RESULT == 1
	IF IS_NONHUMAN(MASTER)
		PRINTFORMW 「You're an interesting youkai. There's something different about you!」
		PRINTFORMDW With that strange and slightly rude comment, the girl approaches you, wearing a friendly smile.
		PRINTFORMW 「It's like there's something about you that stands out... Sorry, I can't explain it better than that.」
		PRINTFORMDW It would make sense for you to stand out, seeing as you're from outside Gensokyo...
		PRINTFORMW 「Huh, really? So, you're like a modern kind of youkai, right? Or is it that you came here after being forgotten?」
	ELSE
		IF TALENT:MASTER:190 == 6
		PRINTFORMW 「You're from outside, right? I can tell!」
		ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「You look like you're a native here, right? I can tell!」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMDW The girl looks quite pleased to have made that deduction, and approaches you with a friendly smile.
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW Seeing as she's wearing a high school uniform, you guess that she must have come from outside, as well.
	PRINTFORMW 「Yep! Well, it's more like I'm visiting... It's complicated, but basically, I come here whenever I sleep.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Right now, I'm dreaming, and Gensokyo is my dream... or, you could say it's the other way around, right?」
	PRINTFORMDW She says some odd things, but she seems approachable, at least. You decide to introduce yourself with your name.
	PRINTFORMW 「That was a reference to Zhuangzi, by the way. You know, the butterfly dream? It's like, when he dreams, he's a butterfly...」
	PRINTFORMDW ...However, she ignores you and starts explaining something or other. After hearing her out, you manage to ask for her name.
	PRINTFORMW 「Sumireko Usami! I'm a student at Higashifukami High... Have you heard of it? Whatever, it doesn't matter.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Since you \@ TALENT:MASTER:190 ? came to Gensokyo # were born in Gensokyo\@, you must be different from the boring people outside. Can you tell me about yourself? Do you have any abilities?」
	PRINTFORMDW It sounds like she wants to be friends. Somehow, you get the feeling she might be a handful, but...
	PRINTFORMDW At least for now, you think you can get along with her.
	CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS = 1
	RETURN 1
ELSEIF RESULT
	GOTO LOOP
ENDIF
PRINTFORMW 「...I knew it, you're %CALLNAME:MASTER% from XX Year X Class at Higashifukami High!」
PRINTFORMDW You're... %NAME:106%, from the same class?!
PRINTFORMDW Why is she in this world...?
PRINTFORMDW Did she come from her own "Dream World"?
PRINTFORMW 「Could it be you're dreaming right now?」
PRINTFORMW
PRINTFORMDW After exchanging information, you learn that she appears to experience the same phenomenon as you.
PRINTFORMW 「Hmm, so you've been able to enter *Gensokyo* recently as well.」
PRINTFORMW 「Then you must be indebted to Reimu-cchi too.」
PRINTFORMDW Certainly, I'm very grateful to her.
PRINTFORMW 「Even so, I never expected that there would be another dreamer in such close proximity.」
PRINTFORMW 「The truth really is stranger than fiction...」
PRINTFORMDW Indeed, while Sumireko is quite infamous for her eccentric nature at school, you didn't expect to connect with her in a place like this.
PRINTFORMDW Let's take this opportunity to get along as both friends in Gensokyo and as classmates.
PRINTFORMDW ...But as you come to that agreement, a sullen look grows on Sumireko's face.
PRINTFORMW 「Friends, huh... Having no flaws is a virtue, but having no virtue is a flaw. Yet you...」
PRINTFORMW 「I mean, it doesn't seem like you have any superpowers or anything like that. In fact, you look super basic.」
PRINTFORMW 「So if you have any trouble in Gensokyo, I'm willing to lend a hand.」
PRINTFORMDW ...While her attitude is annoying, at least she's willing to get along with you.
PRINTFORMDW But it's frustrating enough that you stop time and slip a pebble into her shoe.
PRINTFORMW 「What the...? Yikes, how did that happen?」
RETURN 1

