@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K106_1(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
;地の文
IF LOCAL
    PRINTFORML
	PRINTFORMW 「It's not like \@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?I#we\@ dream normally.」
	PRINTFORMDW On the way home from the date, Sumireko suddenly speaks up.
	PRINTFORMW 「Every time \@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?I#we\@ sleep, \@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?I#we\@ arrive to Gensokyo and live a different reality...」
	PRINTFORMW 「But sometimes, the dreams \@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?I#we\@ have are real.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Even if I'm in Gensokyo, I'm only an illusion here. And the reality is that I'm only dreaming.」
	PRINTFORMDW Sumireko's ramblings makes your head tilt.
	PRINTFORMW 「So that means... I can do something like this!」
	PRINTFORMDW As soon as she says that, Sumireko leaps towards you.
	PRINTL
    PRINTFORMDL Chuuuuu～!
    PRINTW 
	PRINTFORMDW Her feminine aroma tickles your nostrils.
	PRINTFORMDW A soft touch on the lips.
	PRINTFORMDW What seems like a minute——No, an eternity... A dreamy kiss.
	PRINTFORMW 「This is my dream... Not Gensokyo's, not anyone else's... mine.」
	PRINTFORMW 「So you must only be in my dreams, %CALLNAME:MASTER%...」
	PRINTFORMW 「...I'll leave it at that.」
	PRINTFORMDW The beet red Sumireko turns on her heel and runs away.
	PRINTFORMDW You are left stranded, pinching your cheek.
	PRINTFORMDW Only to frown at the dull pain.
	;キスをキャンセルしたい場合は以下を開放
	;TCVAR:キスキャンセル = 1
ENDIF
RETURN 1

