@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K106_2(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白内容
	;この告白内容表示後に受けるかどうかの選択分が表示されます
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, listen.」
		PRINTFORMDW On the way home from the date, Sumireko suddenly stops.
		PRINTFORMW 「I think we've been getting along well lately...」
		PRINTFORMW 「\@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?Even beyond just having the outside world in common, we're...#We hang out in real life, and we're often together in our dreams.\@」
		PRINTFORMW 「...So I think I should make it clear.」
		PRINTFORMDW As she says that, Sumireko raises her head to face you.
		PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, do you see me as a woman?」
		PRINTFORMDW In your eyes, do you...
		;bit lost on that line. MTL points me to "In her words", which seems odd. I thought "In your words" next, but I went with "In your eyes" 
		;it's fine, it basically goes "in response to her words, you..." with a following choice
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白オッケー（恋人が付く）
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		PRINTFORMDW "Of course!", you reply.
		PRINTFORMDW A lot has happened since you first came to Gensokyo.
		PRINTFORMDW Sure, some of the more unique residents certainly boss you around.
		PRINTFORMDW But there is one thing you can say for sure: You're glad you're here.
		PRINTFORMDW Because you got the opportunity to form a bond with Sumireko.
		PRINTFORMW 「I-I see...」
		PRINTFORMW 「...Hahahahahaha! I thought so!」
		PRINTFORMDW Sumireko, whose voice is as quiet as a fly, burst out laughing.
		PRINTFORMW 「Don't get me wrong, it's not like I'm in love with you!」
		PRINTFORMW 「But... If you insist...?」
		PRINTFORMW 「I——I... I can... be... your... lover... if you want!」
		PRINTFORMDW Sumireko says hoarsely.
		PRINTFORMDW Her face is bright red up to her ears.
		PRINTFORMDW It appears she accepts your feelings.
		PRINTFORMDW So then would it be okay to do this...?
		PRINTFORMW 「Hey? A-Ah... Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeehhh～?!」
		PRINTFORMDW You embrace her. Sumireko cries out in a wild yelp.
		PRINTFORMW 「N——No, you hugged me too soon!」
		PRINTFORMDW Sorry, Sumireko is just too cute...
		PRINTFORMW 「Uu... What's with you...」
		PRINTFORMW 「...It can't be helped...」
		PRINTFORMDW Sumireko gently reciprocates your warm embrace.
		PRINTFORMDW This \@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?moment#dream\@ truly feels like an eternity...
		PRINTFORMW
		PRINTFORMW 「\@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?I don't think I ever want to wake up, now...#When I see you in real life, I'll give you my answer again...\@」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白失敗
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		PRINTFORMDW "What do you mean by that?", you respond.
		PRINTFORMW 「.......」
		PRINTFORMW 「No, it's nothing.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Today's dream was fun, see you later.」
		PRINTFORMDW Sumireko walks away without looking you in the eye.
		PRINTFORMDW You could perceive some kind of sadness from her slouched back...
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF

ENDIF
RETURN 1

