				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko looks forward to the next date.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Let's go out on a date in real life next time.」
				PRINTFORMW 「I found a great restaurant we can go to!」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko looks forward to the next date.
				PRINTFORMDW ...Do we even have spare change in real life...?
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕
			PRINTFORMW 「It's such a blessing to be able to see you \@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?when I'm#even when you're\@ asleep...」
			PRINTFORMW 「N-Nothing! I didn't say anything!」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is seething.
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕
			PRINTFORMW 「Thanks for your time, you're quite entertaining.」
			PRINTFORMW 「\@ CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS ?Maybe I'll find a way to pull you outside with me, too...#How about we go on a date when we're awake next time?\@」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko giggles mischievously.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Even though it's a dream, I almost fell asleep.」
			PRINTFORML 「Be more diligent, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko didn't have much fun.
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;反発刻印消去イベント
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
