			PRINTFORMW 「Doesn't *this* seem like the right time? When do you think I'm supposed to do that, then?」
			PRINTFORMDW Come to think of it, she may be right...
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Hey, is that you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
			PRINTFORMW 「...Every time I look at your face, it brings me back to reality.」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko's insult pierces through you...
